A note can include a bare URL that has to wrap: https://example.com/articles/a-very-long-path-segment-that-should-wrap-inside-the-notes-instead-of-overflowing-the-viewport

## What I want to remember

- The title is the link, and it opens in a new tab.
- Notes can be more than one paragraph, with a list underneath.

One more paragraph so the row has real height on both a wide screen and a narrow one.
